out obligations&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Learn about the tasks and activities you need to do in return for your Centrelink payment.&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/individuals/obligations/learn&quot;,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/content/images/learn-about-obligations-card.svg&quot;,&quot;altText&quot;:&quot;Learn about obligations&quot;},&quot;showIf&quot;:&quot;jobseeker-access&quot;},{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Know your obligations&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Learn more about mutual obligation requirements and what you may need to do.&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/individuals/obligations/learn/your-obligations&quot;,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/content/images/know-your-obligations.svg&quot;,&quot;altText&quot;:&quot;Know your obligations&quot;},&quot;showUnless&quot;:&quot;jobseeker-access&quot;},{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;How to meet your obligations&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Understand obligations, including points, the job search requirement, activities and reporting.&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/individuals/obligations/learn/meet-your-obligations&quot;,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/content/images/how-to-meet-your-obligations.svg&quot;,&quot;altText&quot;:&quot;How to meet your obligations&quot;},&quot;showUnless&quot;:&quot;jobseeker-access&quot;},{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;If you don&#x27;t meet your obligations&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Learn about compliance and demerits, and what to do if your circumstances change.&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/individuals/obligations/learn/dont-meet-your-obligations&quot;,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/content/images/if-you-dont-meet-your-obligations.svg&quot;,&quot;altText&quot;:&quot;If you don&#x27;t meet your obligations&quot;},&quot;showUnless&quot;:&quot;jobseeker-access&quot;},{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Pause of obligations&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Latest advice on locations with paused obligations.&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quo